WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.777
Maxie: Taco! Hurry! Follow that truck!

2
00:00:05.778 --> 00:00:07.480
Taco: I’m trying,

3
00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:11.892
Maxie. I’m trying to fly faster.

4
00:00:11.893 --> 00:00:13.659
Maxie: Oh, it’s moving again.

5
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.273
We’ll never catch up.

6
00:00:15.274 --> 00:00:19.791
The marker is gone forever! Taco:

7
00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:22.200
Don’t give up, Maxie! Look!

8
00:00:22.201 --> 00:00:25.307
Maybe he can help us! Maxie:

9
00:00:25.308 --> 00:00:27.058
Oh, excuse me. We

10
00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:28.643
need your help. Clown:

11
00:00:28.644 --> 00:00:31.453
What? I can’t hear you. Taco:

12
00:00:31.454 --> 00:00:35.649
CAN YOU HELP US, PLEASE?

13
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.797
Clown: You don’t have to shout!

14
00:00:37.798 --> 00:00:39.602
What can I do for you? Maxie:

15
00:00:39.603 --> 00:00:40.639
There it is!

16
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.959
Follow that truck! Clown:

17
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:50.670
We’re almost there. Hang on! Taco:

18
00:00:50.671 --> 00:00:54.149
Whoa! Whoa! Slow down.

19
00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:59.126
I feel sick! Maxie:

20
00:00:59.127 --> 00:01:02.011
THANK YOU VERY MUCH! Clown:

21
00:01:02.012 --> 00:01:03.236
You’re welcome.

22
00:01:03.237 --> 00:01:07.286
I have to get back to the zoo. Jack:

23
00:01:07.287 --> 00:01:10.367
Oh! What are you doing here?

24
00:01:10.368 --> 00:01:12.759
Would you like some pizza? Maxie:

25
00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:16.824
No, thanks. Give me the magic marker, please.

26
00:01:16.825 --> 00:01:19.570
Jack: No! It’s mine now!

27
00:01:19.571 --> 00:01:21.733
You can’t have it back!

28
00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:26.911
Taco: What do we do now, Maxie?

